WEBVTT

00:00:05.784 --> 00:00:07.481
[all] Good morning, Master!

00:00:08.787 --> 00:00:11.485
Panda! Panda!

00:00:11.616 --> 00:00:13.226
Wake up!

00:00:14.532 --> 00:00:18.057
[chortling] He's quit.

00:00:19.928 --> 00:00:22.801
What do we do now, Master,
with the panda gone?

00:00:22.931 --> 00:00:24.933
Who will be
the Dragon Warrior?

00:00:25.064 --> 00:00:28.067
All we can do is resume our
training and trust that in time,

00:00:28.198 --> 00:00:30.939
the true Dragon Warrior
will be revealed.

00:00:32.202 --> 00:00:34.595
What are you doing here?!

00:00:34.726 --> 00:00:36.510
Hi! Good morning, Master!

00:00:36.641 --> 00:00:38.556
I thought I'd
warm up a little.

00:00:38.686 --> 00:00:40.732
[straining]

00:00:40.862 --> 00:00:41.820
You're stuck.

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:42.821
Stuck? Nah.

00:00:42.951 --> 00:00:44.997
What? Stuck?
[scoffing]

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:47.913
Nah. This is one of my...
Yeah, I'm stuck.

00:00:48.043 --> 00:00:50.263
- Help him.
- Oh, dear.

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:53.875
Maybe on three.
One, two...

00:00:54.746 --> 00:00:56.139
...three.

00:00:57.662 --> 00:00:59.403
- Thank you.
- Don't mention it.

00:00:59.533 --> 00:01:02.188
- No, really, I appreciate...
- Ever.

00:01:02.319 --> 00:01:06.540
You actually thought
you could learn to do
a full split in one night?

00:01:06.671 --> 00:01:10.196
It takes years to develop
one's flexibility!

00:01:10.327 --> 00:01:13.808
And years longer
to apply it in combat!

00:01:14.287 --> 00:01:15.462
Ooh...

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:26.430
Put that down! The only
souvenirs we collect here

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:29.346
are bloody knuckles
and broken bones.

00:01:29.476 --> 00:01:32.479
Yeah! [chuckling]
Excellent.

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.742
Let's get started.

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:38.659
- Are you ready?
- I was born re...

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:40.792
Ow! [grunting]

00:01:40.922 --> 00:01:43.708
I'm sorry, brother. I thought
you said you were ready.

00:01:43.838 --> 00:01:47.233
That was awesome!
Let's go again!

00:01:52.151 --> 00:01:53.761
Ow! Oh!

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.111
Ahh!

00:01:56.242 --> 00:01:58.201
Ohhh.

00:02:06.034 --> 00:02:09.168
[grunting] Ah... Ow!

00:02:09.299 --> 00:02:11.823
[chuckling]

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:16.349
I've been taking it easy on you,
panda. But no more.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:18.699
Your next opponent will be me.

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:20.788
All right! Yeah, let's go!

00:02:23.138 --> 00:02:25.228
Step forth.

00:02:25.358 --> 00:02:28.666
The true path to victory is to
find your opponent's weakness...

00:02:28.796 --> 00:02:30.581
...and make him
suffer for it.

00:02:30.711 --> 00:02:32.060
Oh, yeah!

00:02:32.191 --> 00:02:33.497
To take his strength

00:02:33.627 --> 00:02:35.586
and use it against him...

00:02:35.716 --> 00:02:38.066
...until he finally falls...

00:02:38.197 --> 00:02:39.242
...or quits.

00:02:39.372 --> 00:02:41.200
But a real warrior
never quits.

00:02:41.331 --> 00:02:44.290
Don't worry, Master.
I will never quit!

00:02:44.421 --> 00:02:47.075
[screaming]

00:02:50.296 --> 00:02:52.559
Ow! Ow!

00:02:54.735 --> 00:02:58.043
If he's smart, he won't
come back up those steps.

00:02:58.173 --> 00:02:59.436
But he will.

00:02:59.566 --> 00:03:01.873
He's not going to quit,
is he?

00:03:02.003 --> 00:03:04.615
He's not going to quit bouncing,
I'll tell you that.

00:03:04.745 --> 00:03:06.225
[laughing]

00:03:06.356 --> 00:03:09.097
[Po] Oh! Ooh! Ah! Ooh!

00:03:12.797 --> 00:03:14.886
[exclaiming]

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.456
I thought you said acupuncture
would make me feel better.

00:03:19.586 --> 00:03:21.632
Trust me, it will.
It's just not easy

00:03:21.762 --> 00:03:24.330
finding the right nerve points
under all this...

00:03:24.461 --> 00:03:27.072
- Fat?
- Fur. I was going to say fur.

00:03:27.202 --> 00:03:29.466
- Sure you were.
- Who am I to judge a warrior

00:03:29.596 --> 00:03:32.512
based on his size?
I mean, look at me.

00:03:33.557 --> 00:03:35.646
- I'm over here.
- Ah-ha!

00:03:35.776 --> 00:03:37.996
Maybe you should
look at this again.

00:03:38.126 --> 00:03:41.129
Oh, OK.

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:43.262
[Po] Ow! [laughing]

00:03:43.393 --> 00:03:46.265
Stop it. Stop!

00:03:46.396 --> 00:03:49.660
I know Master Shifu is trying
to inspire me and all...

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:51.401
...but if I
didn't know better,

00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:53.316
I'd say he was trying
to get rid of me.

00:03:53.446 --> 00:03:56.319
[laughing]

00:03:58.451 --> 00:04:01.149
I know he can seem
kind of heartless...

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.413
...but he wasn't
always like that.

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:06.067
[Viper] According to legend,
there was once a time

00:04:06.198 --> 00:04:09.375
when Master Shifu
actually used to smile.

00:04:09.506 --> 00:04:11.377
- [Po] No!
- [Mantis] Yes.

00:04:11.508 --> 00:04:12.726
[Viper]
But that was before.

00:04:12.857 --> 00:04:14.337
Before what?

00:04:14.467 --> 00:04:16.251
Before Tai Lung.

00:04:16.382 --> 00:04:18.732
We're not really supposed
to talk about him.

00:04:18.863 --> 00:04:21.822
Well, if he's going to
stay here, he should know.

00:04:21.953 --> 00:04:23.955
Guys, guys,
I know about Tai Lung.

00:04:24.085 --> 00:04:26.871
He was a student.
The first ever to master

00:04:27.001 --> 00:04:29.439
the thousand scrolls of kung fu.

00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:33.704
And then he turned bad,
and now he's in jail.

00:04:33.834 --> 00:04:36.141
He wasn't just a student.

00:04:40.275 --> 00:04:43.322
Shifu found him as a cub...

00:04:44.671 --> 00:04:47.457
...and he raised him
as his son.

00:04:50.068 --> 00:04:53.332
And when the boy showed
talent in kung fu...

00:04:54.202 --> 00:04:56.466
...Shifu trained him.

00:04:56.596 --> 00:05:01.558
He believed in him. He told him
he was destined for greatness.

00:05:01.688 --> 00:05:04.343
It was never enough
for Tai Lung.

00:05:06.867 --> 00:05:08.434
He wanted the Dragon Scroll.

00:05:08.565 --> 00:05:12.873
But Oogway saw darkness
in his heart and refused.

00:05:13.004 --> 00:05:17.051
Outraged, Tai Lung
laid waste to the valley.

00:05:19.271 --> 00:05:21.099
He tried to take
the scroll by force.

00:05:21.229 --> 00:05:26.234
And Shifu had to destroy
what he had created.

00:05:27.975 --> 00:05:29.760
But how could he?

00:05:37.028 --> 00:05:42.773
[panting]

00:05:42.903 --> 00:05:48.082
Shifu loved Tai Lung like he
had never loved anyone before.

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:57.570
Or since.

00:06:06.013 --> 00:06:08.799
And now he has a chance
to make things right.

00:06:08.929 --> 00:06:11.105
To train the
true Dragon Warrior.

00:06:11.236 --> 00:06:14.195
And he's stuck with you.

00:06:14.326 --> 00:06:18.722
A big fat panda
who treats it like a joke.

00:06:18.852 --> 00:06:21.115
- Oh, that is it!
- Wait! My fault!

00:06:21.246 --> 00:06:23.422
I accidentally tweaked
his facial nerve.

00:06:25.555 --> 00:06:28.296
And may have also
stopped his heart.

00:06:31.648 --> 00:06:31.665
Inner peace.

